  "decision": "Remediation pass 5: keep the Group 1-3 system's core reasoning (graded proposition relevance, recalibrated source weights, capped same-domain duplicate discount, claim-risk caution tiers, max_sources=15, bounded follow-up retrieval, authority tiebreak, MoritzLaurer/DeBERTa-v3-large-mnli-fever-anli-ling-wanli) unchanged, plus three targeted, multi-fold-validated changes: min_contradiction_confidence 0.70->0.68, a new contradiction-specific relevance floor (-1.5, general floor unchanged at 0.0), and layered URL extraction (favor_recall fallback, JSON-LD/OG-description fallback, generic visible-text fallback, a raised 6MB download limit, one network retry). No further reasoning/model/threshold/extraction change after this lock except a documented, reasoning-neutral harness repair if the evaluation cannot otherwise execute.",
